{
  "path": "/settings",
  "status": 200,
  "headers": {
    "content-type": "text/html; charset=utf-8"
  },
  "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"csrf-token\" content=\"<redacted>\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16'%3E%3Crect width='16' height='16' rx='3' fill='%23141518'/%3E%3Crect x='5' y='5' width='6' height='6' rx='1' fill='%232dd4bf'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\">\n<title>Limits · gitcorpus</title>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  \"use strict\";\n  try {\n    var stored = window.localStorage.getItem(\"gc-theme\");\n    if (stored === \"light\" || stored === \"dark\") {\n      document.documentElement.setAttribute(\"data-theme\", stored);\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    document.documentElement.removeAttribute(\"data-theme\");\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/app.css\">\n<script src=\"/static/htmx.min.js\" defer></script>\n<script src=\"/static/rownav.js\" defer></script>\n<script src=\"/static/applib.js\" defer></script>\n<script src=\"/static/errors.js\" defer></script>\n<script src=\"/static/recentfilters.js\" defer></script>\n<script src=\"/static/modalfocus.js\" defer></script>\n<script src=\"/static/app.js\" defer></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#content\">Skip to content</a>\n<div id=\"nav-progress\" class=\"nav-progress\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<header class=\"site-header\">\n  <a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\">gitcorpus</a>\n  \n  <nav id=\"main-nav\" class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n    <a href=\"/\">Home</a>\n    <a href=\"/runs\">Searches</a>\n    <a href=\"/corpora\">Corpora</a>\n    <a href=\"/filters\">Library</a>\n    <a href=\"/system\" aria-current=\"page\">System</a>\n    <a href=\"/detections\">Detections</a>\n  </nav>\n  <a class=\"status-link\" href=\"/system\" aria-label=\"System status\"><span hx-get=\"/partials/status-dot\" hx-trigger=\"load, every 30s\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\"></span></a>\n  <button id=\"shortcuts-open\" class=\"button ghost\" type=\"button\" data-open=\"shortcuts-modal\" aria-label=\"Keyboard shortcuts\" title=\"Keyboard shortcuts (?)\">?</button>\n  <button id=\"theme-toggle\" class=\"button ghost\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle dark mode\" title=\"Toggle dark mode\">Theme</button>\n</header>\n<main id=\"content\" class=\"content\">\n\n<section class=\"panel\">\n  <div class=\"panel-head\">\n    <h1>Limits</h1>\n    <p class=\"muted\">Run limits for new searches. Part of System.</p>\n  </div>\n  \n  \n  \n  <p class=\"badge\">\n    GitHub token: <strong>present</strong>\n  </p>\n  <form method=\"post\" action=\"/settings\">\n    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"csrf\" value=\"<redacted>\">\n    <section class=\"filter-section\">\n      <h2>Search limits</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">The ranges shown are safety limits — the most you may enter. The\n        corpus-build button picks a recommended profile well inside them.</p>\n      <div class=\"field-grid\">\n        <label class=\"field\">\n          <span class=\"field-label\">Search breadth (slices)</span>\n          <input class=\"field-input\" type=\"number\" name=\"max_shards\" value=\"10\"\n                 >\n          <span class=\"muted\">How many slices a live search may be split into. Broader = longer.\n            Allowed: 1–10,000.</span>\n          \n        </label>\n        <label class=\"field\">\n          <span class=\"field-label\">Repos to keep per search</span>\n          <input class=\"field-input\" type=\"number\" name=\"max_candidates\"\n                 value=\"500\"\n                 >\n          <span class=\"muted\">How many matching repos the search holds on to.\n            Allowed: 1–1,000,000.</span>\n          \n        </label>\n        <label class=\"field\">\n          <span class=\"field-label\">Repos to save details for</span>\n          <input class=\"field-input\" type=\"number\" name=\"max_hydrate\" value=\"200\"\n                 >\n          <span class=\"muted\">How many of those get current details fetched (uses your allowance).\n            Cannot exceed “Repos to keep”. Allowed: 1–1,000,000.</span>\n          \n        </label>\n        <label class=\"field\">\n          <span class=\"field-label\">Extra rules to check</span>\n          <input class=\"field-input\" type=\"number\" name=\"max_enrich\" value=\"100\"\n                 >\n          <span class=\"muted\">How many repos get file and country checks.\n            Allowed: 1–1,000,000.</span>\n          \n        </label>\n        <label class=\"field\">\n          <span class=\"field-label\">Stop a search after (seconds)</span>\n          <input class=\"field-input\" type=\"number\" name=\"request_deadline_seconds\"\n                 value=\"3600\"\n                 >\n          <span class=\"muted\">Long searches abort past this; raise it for corpus builds.\n            Allowed: 60–86,400 seconds.</span>\n          \n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"filter-section\">\n      <h2>Faster saving (batching)</h2>\n      <div class=\"field-grid\">\n        <label class=\"field\">\n          <span class=\"field-label\">Batch repo lookups</span>\n          <input class=\"field-input\" type=\"checkbox\" name=\"graphql_batch\"\n                 checked\n                 >\n          <span class=\"muted\">Faster saving with fewer requests. Off = one request per repo.</span>\n          \n        </label>\n        <label class=\"field\">\n          <span class=\"field-label\">Repos per batch</span>\n          <input class=\"field-input\" type=\"number\" name=\"graphql_batch_size\"\n                 value=\"29\"\n                 >\n          <span class=\"muted\">Larger batches cut request count but raise timeout risk.\n            Allowed: 1–50.</span>\n          \n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"filter-section\">\n      <h2>Request pacing</h2>\n      <div class=\"field-grid\">\n        <label class=\"field\">\n          <span class=\"field-label\">Adaptive request pacing</span>\n          <input class=\"field-input\" type=\"checkbox\" name=\"adaptive\"\n                 \n                 >\n          <span class=\"muted\">Automatically tunes concurrency and batch size to GitHub’s current\n            rate limits. Off = fixed limits.</span>\n          \n        </label>\n        <label class=\"field\">\n          <span class=\"field-label\">Simultaneous requests</span>\n          <input class=\"field-input\" type=\"number\" name=\"limiter_max_concurrent\"\n                 value=\"10\"\n                 >\n          <span class=\"muted\">How many requests run at once. Keep well under GitHub’s ceiling of 100;\n            that ceiling is the allowed maximum, not a target. Allowed: 1–100.</span>\n          \n        </label>\n        <label class=\"field\">\n          <span class=\"field-label\">Discovery workers</span>\n          <input class=\"field-input\" type=\"number\" name=\"discovery_concurrency\"\n                 value=\"32\"\n                 >\n          <span class=\"muted\">How many discovery pages are fetched at once — one page per connection.\n            Together with simultaneous requests, stays well under GitHub’s ceiling of 100.\n            Allowed: 1–64.</span>\n          \n        </label>\n        <label class=\"field\">\n          <span class=\"field-label\">Detection workers</span>\n          <input class=\"field-input\" type=\"number\" name=\"detect_concurrency\"\n                 value=\"32\"\n                 >\n          <span class=\"muted\">How many repos a detection run scans at once — git runs clone this many\n            in parallel. Detection only; searches are unaffected.\n            Allowed: 1–64.</span>\n          \n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <div class=\"form-actions\">\n      <button class=\"button primary\" type=\"submit\">Save</button>\n      <button class=\"button\" type=\"submit\" name=\"preset\" value=\"corpus\">Set to corpus-build limits</button>\n      <button class=\"button\" type=\"submit\" name=\"reset\" value=\"1\">Reset to defaults</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"muted\" id=\"limits-corpus-note\">Set to corpus-build limits picks a coherent overnight\n      profile — 1,000 slices, 100,000 repos per stage, a 24-hour deadline, batching on, adaptive\n      pacing off, 29 repos per call, 32 simultaneous requests, 64 detection workers — not the\n      largest value of every field; environment-pinned fields are left unchanged. The math behind\n      it lives in <code>design/run-limits.md</code>.</p>\n  </form>\n</section>\n\n</main>\n<div id=\"shortcuts-modal\" class=\"modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"shortcuts-title\" hidden>\n  <div class=\"modal-panel\" role=\"document\">\n    <div class=\"panel-head\">\n      <h2 id=\"shortcuts-title\">Keyboard shortcuts</h2>\n      <button id=\"shortcuts-close\" class=\"button ghost\" type=\"button\" data-close=\"shortcuts-modal\" aria-label=\"Close shortcuts\">Close</button>\n    </div>\n    <table class=\"data-table shortcuts-table\">\n      <caption class=\"sr-only\">Keyboard shortcuts</caption>\n      <thead>\n        <tr><th scope=\"col\">Key</th><th scope=\"col\">Action</th></tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"g-h\"><td><kbd>g</kbd> then <kbd>h</kbd></td><td>Go home</td></tr>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"g-f\"><td><kbd>g</kbd> then <kbd>f</kbd></td><td>Go to Find</td></tr>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"g-r\"><td><kbd>g</kbd> then <kbd>r</kbd></td><td>Go to Runs</td></tr>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"g-l\"><td><kbd>g</kbd> then <kbd>l</kbd></td><td>Go to Library (filters)</td></tr>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"j\"><td><kbd>j</kbd></td><td>Select next row</td></tr>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"k\"><td><kbd>k</kbd></td><td>Select previous row</td></tr>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"enter\"><td><kbd>Enter</kbd></td><td>Open selected row</td></tr>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"escape\"><td><kbd>Esc</kbd></td><td>Close this help or a dialog</td></tr>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"question\"><td><kbd>?</kbd></td><td>Toggle this help</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"toast\" class=\"toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" hidden></div>\n</body>\n</html>"
}
